1
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:04,017
Adieu starts with one sentence about your trip.

2
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:14,337
It asks only what it needs, like where you're flying from.

3
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:21,217
Not sure what you like? Swipe, and your trip gets its own personality.

4
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:25,307
It writes a few plans,

5
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:32,990
and an AI critic checks each one before you see it.

6
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:41,613
Pick one, and the route just works: flights in and out, and a hotel in every city.

7
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:46,344
Each plan shows how it fits what you asked.

8
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:50,944
Every stop gets a time. Every day gets a rhythm.

9
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:55,680
Adieu plans your trip like a friend who knows you.
